://si.imgix.net/3f2b6b66/uploads/origins/ebe4112a-560a-496a-8358-3ec03edf6b6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87a47a9df4a0aeb2dd4df30affdf9134 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3f2b6b66/uploads/origins/ebe4112a-560a-496a-8358-3ec03edf6b6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ceeeef98925708d4b8b26edaf3ede526 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3f2b6b66/uploads/origins/ebe4112a-560a-496a-8358-3ec03edf6b6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8593c7b0934269103db6260a9a4f597f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3f2b6b66/uploads/origins/ebe4112a-560a-496a-8358-3ec03edf6b6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8593c7b0934269103db6260a9a4f597f, https://si.imgix.net/3f2b6b66/uploads/origins/ebe4112a-560a-496a-8358-3ec03edf6b6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=662cc033547b616aef22e6079489baa5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3f2b6b66/uploads/origins/ebe4112a-560a-496a-8358-3ec03edf6b6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=26585786defcc1f36e76023dcc788403 3x"}, "body": "*This is a character change to a request we recently received.\nI need an Ori-kyara-chan in a giant present box getup!\nOri-chara reference: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1jTmAEr0Ydd9hjda7H1Ga5oJ_ZFGZyfdZ?usp=share_link\nNo specifics other than pink hair, blue hair ends, and side tails!\n\nThe stuffed animal in a present box is rectangular in shape and upright in posture.\nPlease draw the head and hair out of the stuffed present box as shown in the reference material, and give us a frontal view of the figure in a standing posture!\nThe composition of the picture should be the same as the previous request, but we would appreciate it if you could show the whole body as you did last time.\nI would also appreciate it if you could send me a psd file like the last time.\n\nPlease make it look like she is wearing a giant present box outfit while showing the absolute knee-high area.\nThe present box the character is wearing is large, so her face is on the front side of the box.\nSleeves and skirt do not protrude from the stuffed animal, and the pose will be menacing.\nReference: https://skeb.jp/@relvetic/works/4 (This is the content of our previous request.)\nThe color of the gift box is white and the ribbon is red as in the previous request.\n\nIn summary, the parts inside the costume are the neck, torso, shoulders, and hip joints, and the parts outside the costume are the head, hair, hat, parts above the shoulders (upper arms and forearms), and parts below the hip joints (thighs, legs, knee socks, etc.).\nThe color of the knee socks is white from the illustration of the original character wearing macarons.\n\nIf possible, I would like to see a satisfied, smug expression on her face! If you don't mind, I'd be happy if you could draw the difference of her shy expression.\nI would also be very grateful if you could give me a diff of her arms not sticking out of the gift box (only her legs, head, face, and neck are sticking out).\n\nReference: https://twitter.com/aaa1192s/status/1558693688037232640?s=21&t=CIKNpraa2whphVbjr0X1WQ\n\nI am attracted to the picture of Mr. Rerubechi.\nI am very sorry to make this unusual request again in the midst of your busy schedule, but I would appreciate it very much.\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@relvetic/works/4", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@relvetic/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2328957, "client_id": 748246, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b4271dd3/uploads/origins/bb7ac901-e142-4c8f-8283-af9e8b434e43?bg=%23fff&