eck are showing).\n\nReference: https://twitter.com/aaa1192s/status/1558693688037232640?s=21&t=CIKNpraa2whphVbjr0X1WQ\n\nI am very sorry to make an unusual request in the midst of your busy schedule, but thank you in advance for your cooperation.\n\n\nThe following are illustrations that I have requested from other artists in the past. I hope you will recognize them as reference materials.\nhttps://skeb.jp/@peapplexxx/works/39\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@_KiSaM_/works/17\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@_KiSaM_/works/17", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@relvetic/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2328957, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e7e96078/uploads/origins/a5247a0c-dd83-41b2-9c31-5fb84187dbe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=baf91d237eaa0f497e5dfa4943bcd663", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e7e96078/uploads/origins/a5247a0c-dd83-41b2-9c31-5fb84187dbe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=baf91d237eaa0f497e5dfa4943bcd663, https://si.imgix.net/e7e96078/uploads/origins/a5247a0c-dd83-41b2-9c31-5fb84187dbe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9bdbce9795f54ea95cbc1ecad86ca8c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e7e96078/uploads/origins/a5247a0c-dd83-41b2-9c31-5fb84187dbe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2eb8fe2e60cf9647460b241f635a4154 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e7e96078/uploads/origins/a5247a0c-dd83-41b2-9c31-5fb84187dbe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=60195b112fe4e4dc9dfdf98786790c23", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e7e96078/uploads/origins/a5247a0c-dd83-41b2-9c31-5fb84187dbe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompr